                                "sense_id": "c7f19f57-8016-3881-9824-75a651fa4d37",
                                "text": "This small pond is not in the MDNR hydrography dataset but is part of a larger historical feature bisected by the Project Alignment noted in the MDNR hydrography data as a drained wetland."
                            }
                        ]
